    <string name="help_restart">After restarting your phone</string>
    <string name="help_restart_body">Unlock the phone and start non-root Shizuku again. Automatic recovery and Resume after reboot prepare the recorder when enabled. If it does not reconnect, open ClipHistory and tap Connect. Force stop and Stop recorder remain effective until you explicitly start again. Pause stays saved. Copies made while recording is stopped cannot be recovered.</string>
